OL,3,ASaudi capital airport hit by second
OL,4,Astrike in two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn international airport in the Saudi
OL,7,Fcapital has been hit by a second strike
OL,8,Fin as many days, officials have said.
OL,10,FA Saudi military spokesman said a
OL,11,Fprojectile had hit King Khalid
OL,12,FInternational Airport in Riyadh on
OL,13,FSunday, causing a fire in one of its
OL,14,Fpassenger halls. Saudi Arabia's civil
OL,15,Faviation authority said there had been
OL,16,Finjuries.
OL,18,FIt comes a day after a strike on the
OL,19,Fsame airport killed 13 people and
OL,20,Finjured 308 others, following similar
OL,21,Fstrikes earlier this week.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
