OL,3,ASaudi capital airport hit by second
OL,4,Astrike in two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FYemen's Houthi rebels, who claimed
OL,7,Fresponsibility for the strikes, warned
OL,8,Fairlines and passengers against using
OL,9,FSaudi Arabian airports and airspace.
